mmentBody"><div class=3D"CommentBody-commentStyling"><p>My take is that qui=
cksort, merge sort and all other common sorts involve physically rearrangin=
g memory in a way that would be a bad fit for a list on paper. This one doe=
sn't change the original list, it just emits its elements one at a time in =
order.</p>
